            <ArticleTitle>Discovery of 4-[1-[([1-[4-(trifluoromethyl)benzyl]-1H-indol-7-yl]carbonyl)amino]cyclopropyl]benzoic acid (MF-766), a highly potent and selective EP4 antagonist for treating inflammatory pain.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>3760-3</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1016/j.bmcl.2010.04.065</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The discovery of a highly potent and selective EP(4) antagonist MF-766 is discussed. This N-benzyl indole derivative exhibits good pharmacokinetic profile and unprecedented in vivo potency in the rat AIA model.</AbstractText>
